* Aztec contract standards
** Shared conventions
*** Private notes + public balance per account
*** transfer_<src>_to_<dst>
*** from + nonce, authwit, no approve
*** Commitments (partial notes)
*** PRIVATE_ADDRESS sentinel events
*** 2 then 8 notes per debit round
** AIP-20 / ARC-20 fungible token
*** u128 amounts, public total_supply
*** mint_to_* / burn_* / minter
*** Optional ARC-403 hook
** AIP-721 / ARC-721 NFT
*** NFTNote { token_id }
*** nft_exists + public_owners
*** No hook, no supply
** ARC-1155 multi-token
*** MultiTokenNote { token_id, value }
*** TransferSingle only when id is public
*** No total_supply, id-bearing hook
** ARC-403 authorization hook
*** authorize_private / authorize_public
*** (from, amount, selector), never to
*** Mints not hooked
** AIP-4626 vault
*** Separate AIP-20 share token
*** Standard vs exact pattern
*** vault_offset, VaultDeployer
*** Known u128 overflow, to leak
** Escrow standard
*** Owner = instance salt
*** withdraw / withdraw_nft, private only
*** Logic library, key derivation
** Utilities
*** GenericProxy forwarders
*** Dripper faucet (dev only)
@endmindmap
